  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组由 Aes Efficio 创建</p>\n<h3>Dynamic Village 新增了众多来自 Create 模组的村庄职业 &amp; 建筑。<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x2n2cv6/starongithub.png\" alt=\"星标\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/sudolev/DynamicVillageMod/assets/61996958/40b915c2-4707-4376-a1c0-5ec6a5a55bcc\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<h1>功能列表</h1>\n<p><strong>机械工程师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>收购与出售 Create 附属装置零件</li>\n<li>关键方块：图纸台</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>液压工程师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>收购与出售 Create 流体管理零件——管道、泵、潜水装备等</li>\n<li>关键方块：物品排水口</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>列车技师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>收购与出售 Create 列车系统零件</li>\n<li>关键方块：列车站台</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>矿工</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>收购与出售 Create 采矿设备以及矿物/金属</li>\n<li>关键方块：机械钻头</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>共计 20 座适用于平原、热带草原、沙漠、针叶林和雪原的村庄建筑</h3>\n<h1>参与贡献</h1>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ben001109/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ben001109</a> 将 Dynamic Village 移植至 1.20.1！</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>Bug 反馈、建议与想法</h3>\n<p>Bug 反馈、建议与想法都非常有价值，我们对此深表感谢。通过 GitHub Issue 联系我们是不错的选择。</p>\n<h3>翻译</h3>\n<p>非常感谢大家的翻译帮助。最佳方式是提交一个 GitHub Issue 或 Pull Request。</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/EDGW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EDGW</a> 将 Dynamic Village 翻译为简体中文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/Khaogamermain01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Khao</a> 将 Dynamic Village 翻译为泰语。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/RemVan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RemVan</a> 将 Dynamic Village 翻译为俄语。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamic-village%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上查找 Dynamic Village</h3>\n<h4>报告问题 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/5srLQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4tvGCgv/dynamicvillage.png\" alt=\"Dynamic Village 横幅\"></a></p>\n<p>本模组由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 创作 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> · <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p>",
